        text: 'A therapist presents a clear discriminative stimulus (\'Touch nose\'), waits for the student\'s response, delivers immediate reinforcement for a correct response or a correction procedure for an incorrect response, and then pauses briefly (inter-trial interval) before presenting the next trial. This structured, massed-practice format is repeated across many trials within a session.',
